data from Event Hubs and stores everything in Azure Data Explorer, our TSDB. It also fires
alerts to a custom Azure function whenever temperature anomalies are detected for a
few minutes in a row. The purpose is to avoid having a noisy system that raises too many
alerts. Stream Analytics serves as the processing layer that bridges raw data ingestion
