• Note that Azure Data Explorer is able to ingest data from both IoT Hub and Event Hubs
directly, but we still put Stream Analytics in the middle as we want to route our alerts
directly to Azure Functions. Additionally, while Figure 7.11 is a workable design, an
enterprise-grade solution would rather call for VNet-integrated components with only
IoT Hub exposed to the internet.
However, for the sake of simplicity and cost control, the code sample makes use of public-only
services and does not provision IoT Hub since the real ingestion layer from our processing pipeline
perspective is Event Hubs. For the same reason, we did not use Power BI as it requires specific
licenses, but this would be a valid option for our serving layer. The provided example provisions
exactly what is shown in Figure 7.12.
